Package: CLUnitLogistic
Type: Package
Title: Clustered Unit-Level Logistic Models for Small Area Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Xin", "Wang", email = "wangxin8923@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits unit-level logistic mixed models with area-specific random
    effects in which the area-level regression coefficients are grouped into
    an unknown number of clusters. Clustering is estimated through a penalized
    (MCP) fusion penalty solved by an ADMM-type algorithm, with the number of
    clusters selected by a BIC criterion. The fitted models are used to build
    model-based small area estimators of finite population proportions from
    survey data.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: lme4, cluster, flexmix, stats
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
